	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Panasonic A4S (0.4 mm pitch) header AXE616124D, 16 contacts, 0.8 mm mated height with socket AXE516127D. Land pattern per catalog ACCTB7E 202003 p8 (signal 0.23x0.65, row centres +/-0.875; soldering terminals 0.45x0.53 at x +/-2.20, y +/-0.565). Pad numbers: header pad N mates socket contact N. Library frame = view from the header component side and is the MIRROR of the mating socket top view (Stamp-P4 S013 J2: odd row 1..15, pin 1 at the end opposite pin 15). Intended for bottom-side mounting under an adapter; after the B.Cu flip pad N must sit over socket contact N. Soldering terminals numbered MP (schematic GND).")
	(tags "Panasonic A4S AXE616124 header 0.4mm board-to-board 16P")
